WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,340
I don't know how he died.

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,020
you better tell the truth

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:07,140
I really don’t know that I have been

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,540
It's been a day of interrogation. I need to know that I told them already.

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:12,240
I really don’t know, tell them

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,480
It doesn't mean you don't know

7
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,800
I really don't know if we follow what you said

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,040
Stayed all night in front of the grave

9
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,280
I didn't go back to bed until dawn, I haven't woken up yet

10
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,480
He was taken away by the police and asked how the bald man died.

11
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:31,420
I really don’t know if you’re afraid of Brother Long, you’re afraid that he’ll kill you, but you’re not afraid of my brother, I’ll tell you, I’ll tell you

12
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:36,130
Think it over before talking, brother

13
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,290
Don't say it was me who said it

14
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:43,090
Otherwise, Brother Long will never let me go and say I am suspicious.

15
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:45,830
Why was the bald man killed by Brother Long?

16
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:46,750
Someone must have told Brother Long

17
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:52,630
It was the bald man who confessed him. I don't have any evidence for your guess.

18
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:54,070
But one thing I'm sure of

19
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:56,460
sure what

20
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,350
Baldhead has always been afraid that Brother Long will cause trouble for him

21
00:00:59,590 --> 00:01:01,790
I usually hide it very deep even in the place where I live.

22
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:02,870
Don't dare to let outsiders know

23
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:04,310
Except for a few of our brothers

24
00:01:04,510 --> 00:01:11,460
No one knows where he lives. Where does Baldhead live? Today's words

25
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:15,660
If there is even half a lie, I understand. There is absolutely no big brother. I swear to leave.

26
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:18,720
Your little girlfriend can’t wait. Thank you, brother.

27
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,980
How about it? Don't ask. Go quickly.
